C and annexin II expression in the process of pancreatic carcinogenesis</article-title><source>J Pathol</source><year>2006</year><volume>208</volume><supplement>5</supplement><fpage>673</fpage><lpage>685</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Pathol||208|673||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16450333</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Frohlich</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Motte</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Galvin</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Takahashi</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Wands</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Ozturk</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Enhanced expression of the protein kinase substrate p36 in human hepatocellular carcinoma</article-title><source>Mol Cell Biol</source><year>1990</year><volume>10</volume><supplement>6</supplement><fpage>3216</fpage><lpage>3223</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Mol Cell Biol||10|3216||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2160596</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gerke</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Creutz</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></name><name><surname>Moss</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Annexins: linking Ca2<sup>&#x0002b;</sup> signalling to membrane dynamics</article-title><source>Nat Rev Mol Cell Biol</source><year>2005</year><volume>6</volume><supplement>6</supplement><fpage>449</fpage><lpage>461</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Nat Rev Mol Cell Biol||6|449||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15928709</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gillette</surname>